# GOOGLE_SERVICE_ACCOUNT_JSON: GCP Console -> IAM -> Service Accounts -> Create -> Download JSON key -> minify to one line
# GOOGLE_SERVICE_ACCOUNT_KEY: Minified JSON credentials string for Firestore REST API gateway. IMPORTANT: Vercel environment variables automatically escape newlines (\n) as double-backslashes (\\n) in JSON keys. The backend code cleanses this via .replace(/\\n/g, '\n'), but verify key format before pasting.
# GOOGLE_CALENDAR_ID: Google Calendar -> Settings -> "elo!" calendar -> Scroll to "Integrate calendar" -> Calendar ID
